  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5504.04 Distribution of Photograph. The law enforcement agency shall forward to the division a copy of the photograph taken in accordance with Saf-C 5504.01(f), together with the sex offender or offender against children's registration.\n\nSource. #7982, INTERIM eff 10-30-03, EXPIRED: 4-27-04\n\nNew. #8083, eff 5-11-04; ss by #10121, eff 4-25-12 (from Saf-C 5504.021); ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
